# Resource: scaleway_dataorchestrator_workflow

Manages a Scaleway Data Orchestrator workflow definition.

The `workflow_dsl` attribute is the Open Workflow Specification YAML for the current version.
Updating it calls `UpdateWorkflowVersion` in place (same as Save in the console).

For more information, see the [API documentation](https://www.scaleway.com/en/developers/api/data-orchestrator/).

