## Argument Reference

The following arguments are supported:

- `name` - (Optional, Computed) Name of the workflow definition. If omitted, a random name is generated.
- `workflow_dsl` - (Required) Open Workflow Specification YAML for the current version.
- `version_name` - (Optional, Computed) Name of the workflow version (3-50 chars: letters, digits, `-`, `_`). Defaults to `v1-0-0` on create.
- `description` - (Optional) Description of the workflow definition. Omit the attribute to leave it empty; an empty string is not allowed.
- `version_description` - (Optional) Description of the workflow version. Omit the attribute to leave it empty; an empty string is not allowed.
- `environment_variables` - (Optional) Environment variables of the workflow.
- `workflow_timeout` - (Optional) Workflow timeout as a Go duration string (e.g. `1h`).
- `cron_schedule` - (Optional) Cron schedule of the workflow.
    - `schedule` - (Required) UNIX cron expression.
    - `timezone_identifier` - (Required) Canonical TZ identifier (e.g. `Europe/Paris`).
    - `overlap` - (Optional) Overlap policy (`forbid`, `allow`, `queue`, …).
- `region` - (Optional, Computed, Defaults to [provider](../index.md#arguments-reference) `region`) The [region](../guides/regions_and_zones.md#regions) of the workflow.
- `project_id` - (Defaults to [provider](../index.md#arguments-reference) `project_id`) The ID of the project the workflow is associated with.

## Attributes Reference

In addition to all arguments above, the following attributes are exported:

- `id` - The ID of the workflow definition.

~> **Important:** Data Orchestrator workflow IDs are [regional](../guides/regions_and_zones.md#resource-ids), which means they are of the form `{region}/{id}`, e.g. `fr-par/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111`

- `version_id` - ID of the current workflow version.
- `srn` - Scaleway Resource Name.
- `created_at` - Creation timestamp.
- `updated_at` - Last update timestamp.

## Import

Workflows can be imported using the `{region}/{id}`, e.g.

```bash
terraform import scaleway_dataorchestrator_workflow.main fr-par/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
```
